caption: Every Wuxia Tradition Defines
engine-rule: every-wuxia-tradition-defines

- Legal Style construction, legal mundane foundations, Class-created authorship, and instructional transmission.

- The complete five-Duan-Wei progression and every local addition.

- Affinity rules and the legal Style Shido procedure.

- At least five complete, meaningfully distinct, optional Supernatural Unlock families.

- Every family-specific choice an institutional Style must fix.

- Governing traits, caps, modifiers, resources, activation rules, and failure rules.

- Any Tradition Advantage and Mastery Advantage catalogs the Wuxia Tradition offers, with complete one-to-three prerequisite recipes and either complete GURPS constructions or complete Cinematic Skill Expansions under the derived-advantage rules.

- Consequential-use standards.

- Uniform Tradition Mastery requirements, demonstrations, and benefits.

- If a Sage continuation exists or is explicitly granted, the Advanced Supernatural Unlock catalog or construction procedure, and the boundary between Wuxia Style fields and the Sage Tradition's Dan, family-Mastery, Enhancement, and Lineage Revision rules.
